.TH banner "" "Command"
.SH NAME
banner \- print large sized letters
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbanner [\fIargument ...\fB]\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.HS
banner -- print large sized letters
Usage:	banner [ argument ... ]
Print each 'argument' as one large text output line.
If no args, print each line from standard input as a large output line.
.HE
.B banner
prints large dot-matrix letters on the standard output.
Each
.I argument
produces one large-text output line, nine text lines high, with
each character drawn from a built-in 9-row font.
If there is no
.IR argument ,
each line read from the standard input produces one line of
large-text output instead.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.B lpr
